  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là tần số của nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì tổng số người đi xem là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>46</mn></semantics></math> nên \n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. (1)<br>Độ tuổi đi xem phim nhiều nhất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>34</mn><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên bảng số liệu có mốt là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>34</mn></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>34</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. (2)<br>Từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
